-- erwartet: N055
-- **`state` is a proof device over a carrier declared ELSEWHERE -- and the checker
-- waved it through.** `state Stufe { transition an { s : 0 -> 1 } }` checks with
-- 0 errors: no pass asks which C object holds `s`, and none asks whether `an`
-- CHECKS or WRITES. The emitter's own refusal names both lines
-- (`emit.rs`, the `state` arm); this rule asks the same question one pass earlier.
-- The twin (duplicate transitions) already falls at `N001` (`135`); this probe
-- carries exactly one transition so that only `N055` can fire.
module gift::state_ohne_traeger {

state Stufe {
    transition an { s : 0 -> 1 }
}

}
